        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(ab-cd)^2\\geq0$, so $2abcd\\leq a^2b^2+c^2d^2$.",
          "worked": "A square of a real number is non-negative.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(ab-cd)^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2b^2-2abcd+c^2d^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2b^2+c^2d^2&\\geq2abcd\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      },
