                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Expand and rearrange, or add the three corresponding inequalities from part a.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "As in part a, each square is non-negative.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(ac-bd)^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2c^2-2abcd+b^2d^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2c^2+b^2d^2&\\geq2abcd\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(ad-bc)^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2d^2-2abcd+b^2c^2&\\geq0\\\\a^2d^2+b^2c^2&\\geq2abcd\\end{align*}$$\n\nAdding these inequalities to the result of part a gives\n\n$$a^2b^2+a^2c^2+a^2d^2+b^2c^2+b^2d^2+c^2d^2\\geq6abcd.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
